Package: tekne-apt-sources
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
# satori's packages until the rename (DEC-008). Conflicts makes apt remove
# satori-apt-sources (and its diversions) before this package is unpacked.
Conflicts: satori-apt-sources
Replaces: satori-apt-sources
Description: Tekne's own and third-party APT repositories
 Configures the APT repositories Tekne needs beyond Devuan stable: Tekne's
 own (for Tekne's packages), Brave (for Brave Origin), XLibre (for the X
 server), and Devuan's own excalibur-backports (for the kernel). Each
 repository's signing key is scoped to that repository with Signed-By, and
 APT pins restrict each one to the packages Tekne takes from it.
 .
 Brave's sources file uses the name and key path from Brave's own
 instructions, which makes brave-keyring's postinst remove the key it would
 otherwise link into /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d, where APT trusts it for every
 repository. The key at that path is Tekne's checksum-pinned copy;
 brave-keyring's copy is diverted aside.
